<title>BOSNIA: TABLE - Bosnia July retail prices down 0.3 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Bosnia July retail prices down 0.3 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>SARAJEVO 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistics Bureau of Bosnia's Moslem-Croat federation issued the following economic indicator details on Friday.</p>
<p>    BOSNIA RETAIL PRICES	     JULY     JUNE   JULY 1996</p>
<p>    Monthly change (pct)	     -0.3     +0.2   -0.6</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change		+14.0    +13.0  -34.1</p>
<p>NOTES -- The data cover 51 percent of Bosnia-Herzegovina territory. Data for the country's Serb territory covering the remaining 49 percent are not available. Retail prices in Jan-July 1997 rose 12.2 percent compared to the same period in 1996, the office said.</p>
<p>-- Sarajevo newsroom, +387-71-663-864.</p>
</text>
